{
  "id": "national-championships",
  "name": "National Championships",
  "category": "event",
  "description": {
    "text": "National Championships handed out a promo card stamped with the National Championships logo from 2004, when it was a holo EX Dragon Charizard, to the 2015-2016 season; from 2005 each card also came in a Staff copy. After 2004 they were non-holo copies until 2008-2009, then crosshatch holofoil from Supreme Victors' Garchomp in 2009-2010 to Furious Fists' Blaziken in 2014-2015, and a reverse holo Fates Collide Chaos Tower last.\n\nA season's City, State and National Championships cards were often one evolution line: Charmander, Charmeleon and Charizard from EX Dragon in 2004, then Machop's line in 2005, Whismur's in 2006, Squirtle's in 2007, Shinx's in 2007-2008, Dratini's in 2008-2009, Gible's in 2009-2010, Poliwag's in 2010-2011 and Torchic's in 2014-2015. Other seasons had Karrablast, Accelgor and Escavalier (2011-2012), Eevee, Vaporeon and Espeon (2012-2013), Glaceon, Leafeon and Tropius (2013-2014), and the Stadiums Parallel City, Reverse Valley and Chaos Tower (2015-2016).",
    "sources": [
